# iOS/SwiftPM build output from Tauri mobile plugin builds. These regenerate on
# every `tauri ios` build and carry no source: `.tauri/` is generated Swift API
# scaffolding, `.build/` is the SwiftPM index database. Untracked and unignored,
# they surfaced as ~14 phantom "new files" on whichever branch happened to be
# checked out during a build.
src-tauri/**/.tauri/
src-tauri/**/.build/
**/Package.resolved
